## 1. Lab Overview

This lab documents the complete implementation of **Router-on-a-Stick (ROAS)** together with **centralized DHCP services on a Cisco router**.

In addition to the step-by-step deployment guide, it includes a **Layer 2/Layer 3 troubleshooting** case study: a dynamic IP assignment failure caused by a syntax error in the DHCP exclusion command.

